b:["$","div",null,{"className":"text-box-legal","data-aos":"fade-up","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/Icons/book-solid.png","alt":"Terms of Use","className":"scaled-image-hand-legal"}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"id":"primaryTitleBold","children":"Terms and Conditions of Use"}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"id":"secondary","children":["Terms and Conditions for ",["$","div",null,{"id":"primary","children":"CrowdCount LLC and its products"}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Effective Date: ",["$","div",null,{"id":"primary","children":"February 23rd, 2026"}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"id":"primary","children":"1. Introduction"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Welcome to CrowdCount LLC (collectively referred to as \"CrowdCount\", \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\"). These Terms and Conditions of Use (sometimes referred to as \"Terms\" or \"ToS\") govern your access and use of our app, website, and services. By using our products and services, you agree to these Terms. Please read them carefully.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"id":"primary","children":"2. Usage Restrictions"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Users are prohibited from overloading the API through repeated or excessive calls, whether manual or automated. This includes any activities aimed at disrupting or degrading the performance of our services.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Attempting to hack or gain unauthorized access to our systems, servers, or any related infrastructure is strictly prohibited and will result in immediate termination of access to CrowdCount LLC services."," ",["$","div",null,{"id":"primary","children":"Such actions may also result in civil and criminal liability, including reporting to law enforcement and pursuit of damages to the fullest extent permitted by law."}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"id":"primary","children":"3. Counter Usage and Payment"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Users who purchase a counter are required to pay the full amount as noted on the product page at the time of purchase, this includes the monthly payments. The counter will only be functional upon proper payment. Failure to complete the payment(s) will result in the counter being deactivated or non-functional.",["$","br",null,{}],"This is because the footage from the counter is processed on our servers, and we must ensure that we can maintain the necessary infrastructure to support the counter.",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"id":"primary","children":"4. Device and Account Ownership"}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Hardware Ownership:"}]," Upon full payment of the purchase price, you own the physical Crowd Counter hardware device. However, the software, firmware, and cloud services that enable the device to function remain the property of CrowdCount LLC."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Service Subscription:"}]," The monthly subscription fee covers cloud processing, data storage, API access, and ongoing support. The hardware will not function without an active subscription."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Subscription Lapse:"}]," If your subscription lapses, your counter will be deactivated. Historical data may be retained for a reasonable period to allow for reactivation. After an extended period of non-payment, data may be permanently deleted."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Device Transfer:"}]," You may transfer ownership of your counter device to another party. The new owner must create their own account and subscription. Contact us at ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:info@crowdcount.tech","id":"primary","children":"info@crowdcount.tech"}]," to initiate a transfer."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"No Resale of Services:"}]," You may not resell, sublicense, or provide access to CrowdCount services to third parties without our written permission."]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","Users who choose to make their counter public on our map must adhere to the following rules. Access to the map and public display of the counter will be terminated if any of the following occur:","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","Users found violating these rules will be removed from the public map after receiving enough reports, and further access to the map may be restricted or terminated.","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","Users who create promotions through our app agree to the following:","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","By submitting content to CrowdCount (including promotions, reports, and feedback):","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f","$L40","$L41","$L42","$L43","$L44","$L45","$L46","$L47","$L48","$L49","$L4a","$L4b","You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless CrowdCount LLC, its officers, directors, employees, and agents from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising out of or related to:","$L4c","$L4d","$L4e","$L4f","$L50","$L51","$L52","$L53","$L54","$L55","$L56","$L57","$L58","$L59","$L5a","$L5b","$L5c","$L5d","$L5e","$L5f","$L60","By enabling push notifications in our iOS app:","$L61","$L62","$L63","$L64","$L65","$L66","$L67","$L68","$L69","$L6a","$L6b","$L6c","$L6d","$L6e","$L6f","$L70","$L71","$L72","You must be at least 18 years of age to purchase products or services from CrowdCount. By making a purchase, you represent and warrant that you are at least 18 years old. Minors may use our app and website under the supervision of a parent or legal guardian, but all purchases and account management must be conducted by an adult.","$L73","$L74","$L75","$L76","If you participate in a CrowdCount pilot program or test deployment:","$L77","$L78","$L79","$L7a","$L7b","$L7c","$L7d","$L7e","$L7f","$L80","$L81","$L82","$L83","$L84","$L85","$L86","$L87","$L88","All user data will be stored securely in accordance with our ","$L89",". By using our services, you agree that your counter's data may be stored on our servers, though it will not be publicly accessible unless you choose to display your counter on the public map.","$L8a","$L8b","$L8c","$L8d","We reserve the right to modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. If changes are made, we will notify you through the app, website, or email. Continued use of our services after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the modified Terms. If you do not agree to the modified Terms, you must stop using our services.","$L8e","$L8f","$L90","$L91","If you have any questions or concerns about these Terms, please contact us at: ","$L92"]}]]}]
