3c:["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Count Data:"}]," All data collected by and generated through CrowdCount counter devices, including but not limited to occupancy counts, traffic data, and historical count data, is the property of CrowdCount LLC. You are granted a license to access and use this data for your own purposes while you maintain an active subscription. You may export your count data at any time during your subscription."]}]
